    <description>재보험 영업기회에 Binding Date 가 등록되는 경우, Placement 를 생성</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_AccountName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>CASE({!$Record.BizRegion__c}
 , &quot;LK_KR&quot;, &quot;[KR] LK Insurance Services&quot;
 , &quot;LK_Re&quot;, &quot;[SG] LK Re&quot;
 , &quot;LK_VN&quot;, &quot;[VN] LK Vietnam insurance broker&quot;
 , &quot;&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Inception Date 의 Month 2자리</description>
        <name>fm_InceptionDateMonth</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF ( TEXT ( MONTH ( {!$Record.PeriodFrom__c} ) ) = &quot;10&quot; || 
      TEXT ( MONTH ( {!$Record.PeriodFrom__c} ) ) = &quot;11&quot; || 
      TEXT ( MONTH ( {!$Record.PeriodFrom__c} ) ) = &quot;12&quot;, 
TEXT ( MONTH ( {!$Record.PeriodFrom__c} ) ) ,
&quot;0&quot; &amp; TEXT ( MONTH ( {!$Record.PeriodFrom__c} ) )
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Inception Date 의 Year 2자리</description>
        <name>fm_InceptionDateYear2Char</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>RIGHT ( TEXT ( YEAR ( {!$Record.PeriodFrom__c} ) ), 2 )</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_InceptionDateYear4Char</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>TEXT ( YEAR ( {!$Record.PeriodFrom__c} ) )</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>출처 : 박찬주 수석님(26/3/25)
(예) SF(LK Re, Faculty)-Sequence 5자리 - YYYYMM (Inception)
- S: LK Re_Singapore / K: LK Ins_Korea / V: LK Vietnam / A: LK A&amp;G
- T: Treaty / F: Faculty / R: Retail
- Sequence: 계약별로 채번. 갱신 시, 동일 Sequence 사용, 신규 계약에서만 채번
- YYYYMM: Inception Date 년월</description>
        <name>fm_LKRefNo</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression> {!v_OutputLKRefNo}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_PlacementClient</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!Get_Co_Broker_Producing.Id}), false, {!Get_Co_Broker_Producing.Client__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Inception Date의 YYMM + Cedant Name(약어) + Insured + Cedanct Type1 + Identification Value</description>
        <name>fm_PlacementName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
    ISBLANK({!$Record.CRSIdentificationValue__c}),
    /* 1. CRS 값이 없을 때 */
    IF(
        TEXT({!$Record.BizRegion__c}) = &quot;LK_Re&quot;,
        /* SG이면서 CRS가 없을 때: 아무것도 생성하지 않음 (NULL) */
        LEFT({!fm_InceptionDateYear2Char} &amp; {!fm_InceptionDateMonth} &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; {!$Record.CedantName_lk__r.CompanyAcronym__c} &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; {!$Record.LKInsured__c}, 80),
        /* SG가 아니면서 CRS가 없을 때: 기본 형식 생성 */
        LEFT({!fm_InceptionDateYear2Char} &amp; {!fm_InceptionDateMonth} &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; {!$Record.CedantName_lk__r.CompanyAcronym__c} &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; {!$Record.LKInsured__c} &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; TEXT({!$Record.CedingType1__c})  , 80)
    ),
    /* 2. CRS 값이 있을 때: 지역 상관없이 생성 (CedingType, CRSValue 포함) */
    LEFT(
        {!fm_InceptionDateYear2Char} &amp; {!fm_InceptionDateMonth} &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; 
        {!$Record.CedantName_lk__r.CompanyAcronym__c} &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; 
        {!$Record.LKInsured__c} &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; 
        TEXT({!$Record.CedingType1__c}) &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; 
        {!$Record.CRSIdentificationValue__c}, 
        80
    )
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>보험개시일의 11개월 후를 갱신 예정일로 지정</description>
        <name>fm_PlannedRenewalDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>ADDMONTHS( {!$Record.PeriodTo__c}, -1)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_RenewalOpptyCreate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>ADDMONTHS( {!$Record.PeriodTo__c}, -3 )</expression>
    </formulas>
